By the Wayside
This is a nice example of opening a Tioga file and setting a selection:
BreakProc: IO.BreakProc ~ { -- as default IO.TokenProc except '-, '/, '], '[ aren't separators
RETURN[SELECT char FROM
IN [Ascii.NUL..Ascii.SP], ',, ':,  '; => sepr,
'[, '], '(, '), '{, '}, '", '+, '*, '@, '_ => break,
ENDCASE => other];
};
